@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@bankAccountId = 6610
@depositId = 7300000000000
@paymentId = 6900000000000
@statementDate = 2026-11-23
@previousBankBalance = 1000
@statementBalance = 1025
@requestKey = d11da802-8a96-45db-97e9-51f5702a516a

### Abrir Conciliar. Usar summary.bankBalance y los movementId con canReconcile.
GET {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/reconciliation

### Auxiliar de la partida histórica enfocada con canViewDetail.
GET {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/reconciliation/detail?movementId=1896293

### Registrar el corte de prueba. Usar el saldo y los folios de la cuenta de prueba.
POST {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/reconciliation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{requestKey}}",
  "movementIds": [{{depositId}}, {{paymentId}}],
  "statementDate": "{{statementDate}}",
  "statementBalance": {{statementBalance}},
  "expectedBankBalance": {{previousBankBalance}}
}

### Consultar el saldo conciliado de la cuenta
GET {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}

### Consultar la marca y la fecha en los depósitos
GET {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/deposits

### Banco / Conciliar / Tránsito. Sustituir IDs por una partida pendiente de la cuenta de pruebas.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/reconciliation/transit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movementId": 728980,
  "inTransit": true
}

### Banco / Conciliar / FP. Tomar movementId, policyId y postdateRevision de la partida histórica enfocada.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/treasury/bank-accounts/{{bankAccountId}}/actions/reconciliation/postdate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{$guid}}",
  "movementId": 1895547,
  "policyId": 487185,
  "revision": 0,
  "postDate": "2025-02-26"
}
